387 focos; sumando todos fue 2025, con 7.197. El año más tranquilo de Aqua fue 2015, con 244. Años muy activos alternan con años tranquilos, y eso vuelve difícil leer una tendencia."},{"titulo":"Gobernador Dupuy es el departamento con más focos","texto":"Reúne 16.285 detecciones, el 31 % del total provincial, seguido por General Pedernera y Juan Martín de Pueyrredón."}]},"resumenIncendios":{"generado":"2026-11-15","descargado":"2026-11-15","fuente":"Incendios confirmados: focos de CONAE y NASA FIRMS con area quemada (MCD64A1/VNP64A1) a menos de 1 km en el mismo mes.","todos":{"total":34269,"fechaMin":"2002-01-01","fechaMax":"2026-09-30","porDepto":[{"nombre":"Gobernador Dupuy","total":11423},{"nombre":"Juan Martín de Pueyrredón","total":6137},{"nombre":"General Pedernera","total":4302},{"nombre":"Libertador General San Martín","total":3026},{"nombre":"Coronel Pringles","total":2743},{"nombre":"Chacabuco","total":1858},{"nombre":"Junín","total":1745},{"nombre":"Belgrano","total":1651},{"nombre":"Ayacucho","total":1384}],"porSatelite":[{"satelite":"AQUA","sensor":"MODIS","total":11312,"desde":2002,"hasta":2026},{"satelite":"TERRA","sensor":"MODIS","total":8657,"desde":2002,"hasta":2026},{"satelite":"SNPP","sensor":"VIIRS","total":7635,"desde":2012,"hasta":2026},{"satelite":"NOAA20","sensor":"VIIRS","total":4784,"desde":2019,"hasta":2026},{"satelite":"NOAA21","sensor":"VIIRS","total":1881,"desde":2024,"hasta":2026}],"porAnio":[{"anio":2002,"total":2616},{"anio":2003,"total":3145},{"anio":2004,"total":243},{"anio":2005,"total":784},{"anio":2006,"total":469},{"anio":2007,"total":379},{"anio":2008,"total":644},{"anio":2009,"total":2600},{"anio":2010,"total":258},{"anio":2011,"total":443},{"anio":2012,"total":365},{"anio":2013,"total":1197},{"anio":2014,"total":700},{"anio":2015,"total":256},{"anio":2016,"total":993},{"anio":2017,"total":1981},{"anio":2018,"total":1581},{"anio":2019,"total":617},{"anio":2020,"total":2986},{"anio":2021,"total":1021},{"anio":2022,"total":214